  "identity": "Drowned archive guardian in an antique squat brass diving suit. Its HEAD is an enormous tarnished bronze church bell with a dark opening and little dangling clapper like a tongue; two tiny pale eye glints inside. Sea-green patina, kelp collar, leather hose coils and oversized diver mittens, short heavy lead boots. A handbell hangs from its belt. Offended fussy custodian.",
